.TH BIOSEQ.FASTA 4 2000-1月 "read.fingerprint_bson" "read.fingerprint_bson"
.SH NAME
read.fingerprint_bson \- read the sequence fingerprint data from a binary BSON format fingerprint
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIread.fingerprint_bson(\fBfile\fR as any, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
read the sequence fingerprint data from a binary BSON format fingerprint 
 matrix file
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBfile\fB \fR\- 
 the file path of the fingerprint matrix file that is generated by the 
 \fBwrite_fingerprint\fR api, or a file stream object of the target 
 fingerprint matrix file.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment object.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a pipeline object of the @\fBT:SMRUCC.genomics.Model.OperonMapper.NTCluster\fR sequence fingerprint data;
 
 this function returns a R# error message object if the given file can not be 
 opened for read.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
bioseq.fasta
.SH FILES
.PP
seqtoolkit.dll
.PP
